  "title": "Qualia rest on a category mistake",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "2d4118d1-c863-4dbd-84df-31249e3a014d",
      "text": "Qualia are meant to be properties of experiential states, but experiences are not states. They are ways of acting, things done. So in this sense there are no visual qualia, and qualia are an illusion.",
